  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee.Beneficiaries: 1400 (741 women).Description: The group seeks to increase their production and sale of high quality specialty coffee with additional collection centers, a renovated coffee washing station for processing, a warehouse for storage, agronomy and business trainings, and working capital for cherry purchases and crop transportation.</narrative>
